@prefix cmpe: <https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/> .
@prefix ex: <urn:cmpe:review:> .

ex:org1 a cmpe:Organization, cmpe:RegulatoryAuthorityRole .
ex:vulnerability a cmpe:Vulnerability .
ex:capability a cmpe:EnterpriseCapability ; cmpe:capabilityBearer ex:org1, ex:wrong .
ex:wrong a cmpe:MedicinalProduct .
ex:oversight a cmpe:RegulatoryOversight ; cmpe:oversightAuthorityRole ex:org1 ; cmpe:oversightGovernedEntity ex:org1 .
ex:partnership a cmpe:StrategicPartnershipAgreement ; cmpe:partnershipParticipant ex:org1 .
